{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Therefore thus says the Holy One of Israel.</b> In the prophecy." "<b>This iniquity shall be to you.</b> And in their oppression." "<b>That this people has refused.</b> The name of the attribute, and likewise the vav, and the word <b>נלוז</b> as in <i>for an abomination to YHWH is the perverse</i> <small>(Proverbs 3:32)</small>."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:59.066043327Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}